{
  "about": "The exact requests crw's missions adapter sends to Robob (test/missions.test.mjs asserts the adapter still sends these bodies). The Robob fork copies this file into apps/server/src/ardud/missions/import/crwContract.fixture.json and replays it against the real route layers, so a shape change on either side fails a test. Calls carry crw's own component credential (t3 ardud component-token issue crw); the server knows the caller is crw from that token, and no identity header (x-t3-component, x-t3-thread-id) is sent. $hold.id and $hold.fence stand for the hold the take-hold call returned. To switch the adapter on: write the credential (zsh missions-cutover.zsh --credential crw --go writes ~/.robob/components/crw.json, chmod 600; or set T3_MISSIONS_TOKEN), then set missions.enabled true in crw's config.json. Without the credential crw sends nothing here, never on the control token.",
  "component": "crw",
  "mission": "crpko",
  "pool": "crpko:pool:reviews",
  "requests": [
    {
      "name": "open approval",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/approvals/open",
      "body": {
        "missionId": "crpko",
        "approvalId": "crpko:approval:crw:Equicom-Crypto/edge-api#901@aaaaaaaaaaaa",
        "kind": "merge",
        "title": "Merge and deploy (Good to merge): Equicom-Crypto/edge-api#901 Fix the thing",
        "detail": "looks right\n\nApproving covers the merge and the deploy to dev. We pick the deploy time, fix what comes up and get fresh checks after our own pushes without coming back to you. Decide here, or reply Approved in the review thread (head aaaaaaaaaaaa).",
        "requestedBy": "crw",
        "links": [
          {
            "kind": "pull-request",
            "label": "Equicom-Crypto/edge-api#901",
            "url": "https://github.com/Equicom-Crypto/edge-api/pull/901",
            "ref": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
          }
        ],
        "summary": "looks right",
        "flags": ["padding"]
      },
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "seq", "ref"] },
      "repeat": { "status": 200 }
    },
    {
      "name": "read approvals",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/approvals?mission=crpko&id=crpko%3Aapproval%3Acrw%3AEquicom-Crypto%2Fedge-api%23901%40aaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "approvals"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "record review",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/reviews",
      "body": {
        "missionId": "crpko",
        "pullRequest": { "repository": "Equicom-Crypto/edge-api", "number": 901 },
        "stageId": "reviewer",
        "headSha": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
        "verdict": "clear",
        "links": [
          {
            "kind": "pull-request",
            "label": "Equicom-Crypto/edge-api#901",
            "url": "https://github.com/Equicom-Crypto/edge-api/pull/901",
            "ref": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "seq", "ref"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "record PR facts",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/criticality/facts",
      "body": {
        "missionId": "crpko",
        "pullRequest": { "repository": "Equicom-Crypto/edge-api", "number": 901 },
        "facts": {
          "changedLines": 42,
          "paths": ["src/a.go", "src/b.go", "src/old.go"],
          "labels": ["backend"]
        }
      },
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "recorded", "verdict"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "review plan",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/review-plan",
      "body": {
        "missionId": "crpko",
        "pullRequest": { "repository": "Equicom-Crypto/edge-api", "number": 901 },
        "headSha": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
      },
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "plan"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "roles",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/roles?missionId=crpko",
      "expect": {
        "status": 200,
        "keys": ["ok", "missionId", "roles", "defaults", "bindings", "drift"]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "pools",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/pools?missionId=crpko",
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "pools", "at"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "take hold",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/pools/holds",
      "body": {
        "poolId": "crpko:pool:reviews",
        "missionId": "crpko",
        "amount": 1,
        "purpose": "crw review Equicom-Crypto/edge-api#950 at dddddddddddd",
        "ttlSeconds": 25200
      },
      "expect": { "status": 200, "keys": ["ok", "hold", "queuePosition", "overCapacity"] }
    },
    {
      "name": "release hold",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/pools/holds/release",
      "body": {
        "holdId": "$hold.id",
        "fence": "$hold.fence",
        "note": "review delivered (Good to merge)"
